  <main>
    <section class="hero"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521791136064-7986c2920216?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A couple meeting with their attorney across a desk" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future on">Future</span></div>
        <h1>Wills, trusts, and a plan <em>for your family.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Tercet Law is an estate planning firm: your will, your trust, your health directive, and the people you choose to carry it out. Flat fees, quoted up front. Virtual appointments.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">Thirty-minute planning call. No charge, no pressure.</p>
      </div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>3</b><span>Documents every adult needs</span></div><div><b>Flat</b><span>Fees, quoted up front</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Attorney, start to finish</span></div><div><b>AL</b><span>Licensed · Texas admission pending</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="split" id="problem"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609220136736-443140cffec6?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop');background-position:center" role="img" aria-label="A family at the dinner table"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why now</p><h2>Everyone means to do it. Most never do.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li>Without a will, the state decides who gets what, and who raises your kids.</li><li>A trust that was never funded protects nothing.</li><li>A health directive spares your family the hardest guess.</li></ul>
    </div></section>

    <section class="split rev alt" id="approach"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop');background-position:center" role="img" aria-label="Hands signing a document with a fountain pen"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we plan</p><h2>One attorney. One flat fee. Done right.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li>We start with your family and your wishes, not a form.</li><li>You get the will, the trust, the directive, and the powers of attorney, explained in plain English.</li><li>We fund the trust with you, so it actually works.</li><li>You leave with a plan you can live by.</li></ul>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/process">See the process</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/services">Practice areas</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who we serve</p><h2>Where are you in life?</h2></div>
      <div class="pcards"><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1475609471617-0ef53b59cff5?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A parent holding a child close" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Starting out</span><b>Young families</b><em>Guardians, a will, and life insurance pointed the right way.</em></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511895426328-dc8714191300?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family walking on the beach" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Building</span><b>Established households</b><em>A trust, a funded one, and a plan for the house, the accounts and the kids.</em></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581579186913-45ac3e6efe93?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Three generations of a family with their dog" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Later in life</span><b>Elders and their children</b><em>Elder law, probate and the conversations nobody wants to start.</em></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec" id="what"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Practice areas</p><h2>Everything a family needs, under one roof.</h2></div><div class="gallery five"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521791055366-0d553872125f?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Signing a will at a desk" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Wills and directives</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family home with a wide front porch" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Trusts</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-6726b3ff858f?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Estate paperwork on a desk" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Probate</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593100126453-19b562a800c1?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A grandmother hugging her grandchild" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Elder law</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758518730136-1bf4fa26ccbf?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Business owners talking around a table" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Business succession</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your attorney</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">An attorney since 2014, based in Austin. Twenty years leading organizations alongside the practice. He treats your plan as the start of a life, not the end of one.</p><blockquote>A good plan is not about dying. It is about the people you love knowing exactly what you wanted.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/about">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">Start with a free planning call.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>The call</h3><p>Thirty minutes. What you have, what you want, what it costs.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>The plan</h3><p>One flat fee. Will, trust, directive, powers of attorney. Signed and explained.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>The life</h3><p>We fund the trust, you keep the plan, and we are here when life changes.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="after"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What changes</p><h2>When it is done.</h2></div>
      <div class="after"><div><b>Your family knows.</b><p>Who decides, who inherits, and where everything is.</p></div><div><b>Nothing is left to the court.</b><p>A funded trust keeps your estate out of probate.</p></div><div><b>You can stop worrying about it.</b><p>It is written, signed and done.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>Simple to start.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Essentials</h3><div class="price ">From $1,500</div><p>Will, health directive, powers of attorney. Signed and explained.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/pricing">See fees</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Most chosen</div><h3>The Trust Plan</h3><div class="price price-word">Quoted</div><p>Revocable trust, funded. Everything in the Essentials.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="/pricing">See fees</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For business owners</div><h3>Succession</h3><div class="price price-word">Quoted</div><p>Who runs the company if you cannot. Buy-sell, operating agreements, the hand-off.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="/pricing">See fees</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Flat fees, quoted on the call. No hourly billing on planning work.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Past · Present · Future</p><h2>Part of Vault Human.</h2><p class="lede">A tercet is three lines that belong together. So is a plan: your will, your trust, and the directive that says what you want. Tercet Law is the law firm in the Vault Human family. It is a law firm, not coaching.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Modernizes how your work runs: tools, workflows, AI. Not a coach. Not a law firm.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>Executive, leadership and team coaching for companies. Not a law firm.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy me" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com"><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet Law</h3><p>The law firm. Wills, trusts, probate and a plan for your family. Not coaching.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Tercet Law do?</summary><p>Estate planning and elder law: wills, trusts, health directives, powers of attorney, probate and business succession. Flat fees.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a trust?</summary><p>Sometimes. The call tells you honestly, and the price is the same either way.</p></details><details><summary>Where are you licensed?</summary><p>Alabama, with Texas admission pending. Based in Austin. Virtual appointments.</p></details><details><summary>How long does it take?</summary><p>Most plans are signed within three to four weeks of the first call.</p></details><details><summary>What is Vault Human?</summary><p>Daily coaching, run by the same owner. It is separate from your legal work and never required.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609220136736-443140cffec6?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family at the dinner table" loading="lazy" /><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Book a planning call.</h2><p class="lede">Thirty minutes. You leave knowing what you need and exactly what it costs.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

